  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "I know I should have... the form... I didn\u2019t check it as carefully
      as I..."
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: "I was a teacher. I was very... it doesn\u2019t matter what I was."
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Look at me, Shorena.
      npcResponse: "I know. I know how I look. You don\u2019t have to..."
      animationTrigger: 
    - playerChoiceText: What happened to you?
      npcResponse: Nothing. Everything is... nothing happened. I just got tired.
      animationTrigger: 
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "My daughters are... they\u2019re fine. They don\u2019t need me to..."
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Do whatever you need to do. I don't have anything to argue about.
